WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.352
The school Sunday sequence begins with normal obstetric physiology, then moves into preeclampsia, eclampsia and ectopic pregnancy. This session follows that order.
学校周日先教正常产科生理，再进入先兆子痫、子痫和异位妊娠。本节按这个顺序展开。

00:00:11.352 --> 00:00:22.752
Seven C Part B explains pregnancy adaptation and aortocaval compression. We will connect those mechanisms to the actual assessment, positioning and changing vital signs.
7C Part B解释妊娠适应及主动脉腔静脉压迫。我们会把机制连到实际评估、体位及变化的生命体征。

00:00:22.752 --> 00:00:32.160
The aim is not to call every unusual value normal pregnancy. Establish the baseline so you can recognize a meaningful deviation earlier.
目标不是把每个异常值都叫正常妊娠，而是先建立基线，好让你更早识别有意义的偏离。

00:00:32.160 --> 00:00:42.888
Use the paired reading and original cases to practise the school What Else check. These are teaching examples, not the school assessed cases or completed assignments.
请结合中英阅读和原创病例练学校的What Else检查。这些是教学例子，不是学校考核病例或已完成作业。

00:00:42.888 --> 00:00:55.200
Begin with the same scene and primary assessment used for any patient. Identify immediate airway, breathing, circulation and neurological threats before a long obstetric history.
仍应从所有患者通用的现场及初评开始。在长篇产科病史之前，先找气道、呼吸、循环及神经即时威胁。

00:00:55.200 --> 00:01:05.808
Then identify the gestational stage and the person usual health. The same pressure or breathlessness can have different meaning at different stages and baselines.
再明确孕期阶段及本人平常健康。同样血压或气促，在不同阶段和基线可能意义不同。

00:01:05.808 --> 00:01:17.376
Ask about current pregnancy, a recent birth or a pregnancy loss. The absence of a visibly enlarged abdomen does not remove pregnancy-related or postpartum causes.
应问当前妊娠、近期分娩或妊娠丢失。腹部没有明显增大，并不能排除妊娠相关或产后病因。

00:01:17.376 --> 00:01:29.304
Respect privacy and use clear language without assuming family structure, prior outcomes or a desired pregnancy. The patient account remains central wherever they can participate.
请尊重隐私、清楚沟通，不预设家庭结构、既往结局或本人是否期待妊娠。只要患者能参与，其陈述仍是核心。

00:01:29.304 --> 00:01:41.424
Maternal circulating volume increases to support the growing uteroplacental circulation and changing maternal metabolic demand. The amount varies with gestation and individual factors.
母体循环容量增加，以支持增长中的子宫胎盘循环及母体代谢需求。增加幅度随孕期和个人因素变化。

00:01:41.424 --> 00:01:51.504
The school approximate forty-to-fifty percent increase is a useful scale for understanding adaptation. It is not a measured blood volume for every pregnant patient.
学校所说约40%至50%的增加，可帮助理解适应幅度，但不是每个孕妇的实测血容量。

00:01:51.504 --> 00:02:02.664
Greater volume and physiological compensation can mask developing hemorrhage. A reassuring-looking first pressure does not exclude significant or continuing blood loss.
容量较大及生理代偿可能掩盖进展中的出血。初次血压看似放心，仍不能排除显著或持续失血。

00:02:02.664 --> 00:02:14.112
Follow mentation, skin, pulse, breathing, bleeding and the trend together. Do not wait for a textbook percentage loss or a late pressure collapse before acting.
请把意识、皮肤、脉搏、呼吸、出血及趋势合看。不能等达到教材失血百分比或晚期血压崩溃，才开始行动。

00:02:14.112 --> 00:02:23.880
Plasma expands more than red-cell mass, so hemoglobin concentration and hematocrit can fall even while the total red-cell mass increases.
血浆扩张多于红细胞总量，因此即使红细胞总量增加，血红蛋白浓度及红细胞压积仍可下降。

00:02:23.880 --> 00:02:36.744
This explains physiological hemodilution, but it does not classify every low hemoglobin as normal. Gestational stage, iron status, symptoms and bleeding remain relevant.
这解释了生理性血液稀释，但不能把所有低血红蛋白都判正常。孕期、铁状态、症状和出血仍然重要。

00:02:36.744 --> 00:02:50.088
The school hemoglobin examples are not universal trimester-independent normal values. A single numerical range must not replace interpretation of the actual laboratory and clinical context.
学校的血红蛋白例值不是不分孕期的普遍正常值。一个数值范围，不能替代对真实化验和临床背景的解释。

00:02:50.088 --> 00:03:02.592
Saturation describes a proportion, not how much hemoglobin is present or how well blood reaches tissues. A normal saturation alone does not solve anemia or hemorrhagic shock.
血氧饱和度描述比例，不能说明血红蛋白有多少，也不能说明血流是否有效到达组织。血氧正常，单独解决不了贫血或失血休克。

00:03:02.592 --> 00:03:14.184
Cardiac output increases through changes in both stroke volume and heart rate. Systemic vascular resistance generally decreases as pregnancy promotes vasodilation.
心输出通过每搏量和心率变化而增加；妊娠促进血管扩张，全身血管阻力一般下降。

00:03:14.184 --> 00:03:23.832
The school percentages and a ten-to-twenty beat increase describe approximate adaptation. They are not a promise that a particular rate is harmless today.
学校百分比和每分钟增加10至20次描述大致适应，不保证今天某个具体心率就无害。

00:03:23.832 --> 00:03:37.776
A rapid rate accompanied by fever, poor perfusion, chest pain, breathlessness or new confusion needs explanation. Do not label a symptomatic supraventricular tachycardia normal pregnancy.
快速心率若伴发热、低灌注、胸痛、气促或新意识混乱，就需要解释。不能把有症状的室上速叫正常妊娠。

00:03:37.776 --> 00:03:48.792
Look for causes such as hemorrhage, infection, dysrhythmia or thromboembolism while supporting current threats. A known adaptation is only one part of the reasoning.
应在支持当前威胁同时，查出血、感染、心律问题或血栓栓塞等原因。已知生理适应，只是推理的一部分。

00:03:48.792 --> 00:03:59.112
Pressure may decrease during early or midpregnancy and return toward the prepregnancy level later. Use the actual stage and known prior values when available.
早中孕血压可能下降，后期趋近孕前水平。可得时应结合真实孕期及既往数值。

00:03:59.112 --> 00:04:10.872
Confirm measurement technique, cuff size, limb and position. A change produced by positioning or an unsuitable cuff must be distinguished from a true physiological trend.
需核测量技术、袖带大小、肢体及体位。体位或不合适袖带造成的变化，必须与真实生理趋势区分。

00:04:10.872 --> 00:04:22.032
Neither a population-normal value nor a single high value tells the entire perfusion story. Compare function, symptoms and the repeated observations.
人群正常值或单个高值，都讲不全灌注情况。请比较功能、症状及重复观察。

00:04:22.032 --> 00:04:31.896
Later we will use the pregnancy-specific hypertension thresholds. They are different from simply applying a generic adult chronic-pressure chart to an acutely ill patient.
稍后会使用妊娠特定高血压阈值。这不同于把普通成人慢性血压表，直接套到急病患者。

00:04:31.896 --> 00:04:43.008
Pregnancy increases oxygen consumption. The enlarging uterus also elevates the diaphragm and reduces the functional residual capacity available as an oxygen reservoir.
妊娠增加耗氧，增大的子宫又抬高膈肌，减少可作为氧储备的功能残气量。

00:04:43.008 --> 00:04:52.728
The school approximate twenty-percent demand increase and twenty-percent reserve reduction explain the direction of risk, not a fixed measurement for every stage.
学校约20%的需求增加及约20%的储备下降，说明风险方向，不是每个孕期都固定相同的实测。

00:04:52.728 --> 00:05:04.032
Less reserve with higher demand means hypoxemia may develop faster during apnea or ineffective ventilation. Recognize and support inadequate breathing promptly.
储备少、需求高，意味着无呼吸或通气无效时，低氧可能更快出现。需及时识别并支持不足呼吸。

00:05:04.032 --> 00:05:14.928
Do not delay maternal ventilation for a fetal-heart check or a complete history. Effective maternal oxygenation and circulation are fundamental to fetal support.
不能为了先查胎心或问完整病史而延误母体通气。有效的母体氧合和循环，是支持胎儿的基础。

00:05:14.928 --> 00:05:26.256
Minute ventilation increases mainly through greater tidal volume. The school uses an approximate forty-to-fifty percent rise to explain pregnancy acid-base adaptation.
分钟通气主要随潮气量增大而增加。学校用约40%至50%的上升，来解释妊娠酸碱适应。

00:05:26.256 --> 00:05:40.176
Expected PaCO2 is lower, often around twenty-eight to thirty-two millimeters of mercury, with renal bicarbonate compensation. Interpret values in pregnancy context rather than the usual nonpregnant baseline.
预期PaCO2较低，常约28至32 mmHg，并伴肾性碳酸氢盐代偿。需按妊娠背景解释，不能只用非孕基线。

00:05:40.176 --> 00:05:53.184
A PaCO2 near forty may therefore be relatively elevated, but one value alone does not diagnose respiratory failure. Combine the gas, effort, ventilation, oxygenation and clinical trend.
因此PaCO2接近40可相对偏高，但单个值不能诊断呼衰。需结合血气、呼吸功、通气、氧合及临床趋势。

00:05:53.184 --> 00:06:05.280
The textbook sentence giving respiratory rate in liters per minute mixes units. Do not convert it into ten breaths per minute or dismiss pronounced tachypnea as automatically physiological.
教材有一句用每分钟升数写呼吸频率，混淆了单位。不能把它改读成每分钟十次，也不能自动把明显呼吸急促当生理现象。

00:06:05.280 --> 00:06:17.736
Pregnancy-related mucosal vascularity and swelling can increase bleeding and airway difficulty. Gastrointestinal and mechanical changes may also increase aspiration concerns.
妊娠相关黏膜血管丰富及肿胀，可增加出血和气道困难。胃肠及机械变化也可能增加误吸担忧。

00:06:17.736 --> 00:06:28.440
Assess the actual airway and breathing. Prepare suction, a useful position and effective basic ventilation with the appropriate permitted adjuncts and assistance.
应评真实气道呼吸，准备吸引、有用体位，以及配合适当获准辅助和人手的有效基本通气。

00:06:28.440 --> 00:06:40.104
Request experienced help early if support is failing. Oxygen attached to a mask is not proof that air reaches the lungs, and a good saturation can lag behind deterioration.
若支持失败，应尽早请求有经验支援。面罩接上氧气，不证明气体到达肺内；血氧尚好也可能落后于恶化。

00:06:40.104 --> 00:06:51.672
Specialist intubation and drug discussions explain risk but do not create new PCP authority. The priority remains effective support without unnecessary interruption.
专科插管及用药讨论能解释风险，却不会增加PCP权限。优先仍是不中断必要支持地维持有效照护。

00:06:51.672 --> 00:07:03.336
Renal blood flow and filtration increase in pregnancy, while changes to the urinary tract can promote stasis. Ask about the change from usual frequency and actual urine output.
孕期肾血流及滤过增加，而尿路变化可促进淤滞。应问相对平常尿频的变化，以及真实尿量。

00:07:03.336 --> 00:07:16.440
Painful urination, fever or flank pain suggests more than ordinary bladder pressure. Systemic infection or renal dysfunction may develop and must not be hidden behind a pregnancy label.
尿痛、发热或腰侧痛，提示不只是普通膀胱受压。全身感染或肾功能异常可能发展，不能被妊娠标签掩盖。

00:07:16.440 --> 00:07:27.912
Reflux and nausea are common, but persistent vomiting with poor intake, dehydration, blood or altered function needs evaluation and condition-specific care.
反流恶心很常见，但持续呕吐伴摄入差、脱水、血液或功能变化，需要评估及特定病情照护。

00:07:27.912 --> 00:07:38.568
Check glucose and perfusion where indicated. Avoid a routine high-oxygen, large-fluid or standing-orthostatic bundle merely because an older chapter lists it.
有指征时应查血糖及灌注。不能只因旧章节列过，就常规套用高氧、大量液体或站立体位性测量套餐。

00:07:38.568 --> 00:07:49.872
Pregnancy increases clotting tendency, and venous stasis can add to thromboembolic risk. This is a mechanism to remember when the complaint is not obviously obstetric.
妊娠增加凝血倾向，静脉淤滞又可增加血栓栓塞风险。主诉看似非产科时，也需要记住这个机制。

00:07:49.872 --> 00:08:02.232
Sudden unexplained dyspnea, chest pain, collapse or asymmetric limb findings requires evaluation. Neither pregnancy nor anxiety alone is an adequate explanation.
突发不明气促、胸痛、倒地或肢体不对称发现，都需评估。单凭怀孕或焦虑，不能充分解释。

00:08:02.232 --> 00:08:12.216
The postpartum period remains relevant. Ask when birth occurred and whether there were complications, reduced mobility or new cardiopulmonary symptoms.
产后时期仍然重要。应问分娩时间、有无并发、活动减少，以及新心肺症状。

00:08:12.216 --> 00:08:25.656
Support the actual ABC and perfusion problems and mobilize appropriately. This recognition lesson does not authorize independent anticoagulation or prove a field embolism diagnosis.
需支持真实ABC及灌注问题，并适当动员转运。本识别课不授权独立抗凝，也不能确证现场栓塞诊断。

00:08:25.656 --> 00:08:35.640
An expected adaptation should fit the stage, scale and overall condition. It should not require you to ignore a major change in function or perfusion.
预期适应应符合阶段、幅度及整体病情，不应要求你忽略明显功能或灌注变化。

00:08:35.640 --> 00:08:44.448
A higher pulse with fever, new confusion and reduced urine output is not explained simply by a normal pregnancy heart-rate rise.
较快脉搏若同时有发热、新意识混乱和尿量减少，就不能简单用正常妊娠心率上升来解释。

00:08:44.448 --> 00:08:56.208
Likewise, severe breathlessness is not safely labelled diaphragm displacement without assessing oxygenation, ventilation, circulation and dangerous alternatives.
同样，严重气促不能未经氧合、通气、循环及危险鉴别评估，就放心归于膈肌上抬。

00:08:56.208 --> 00:09:06.480
State the working explanation and one dangerous alternative. Then choose an observation or action that can change the plan while immediate care continues.
请说出工作解释及一个危险鉴别，再选能改变计划的观察或行动，同时不中断即时照护。

00:09:06.480 --> 00:09:18.024
After roughly twenty weeks, a sufficiently enlarged uterus can compress the inferior vena cava when the patient is supine. The effect depends on size and actual position.
约20周后，足够增大的子宫可在仰卧时压下腔静脉。效应仍取决于体积和实际姿势。

00:09:18.024 --> 00:09:29.064
Reduced venous return lowers cardiac filling. If compensation is insufficient, stroke volume and cardiac output fall, producing a positional perfusion problem.
静脉回流减少会降低心脏充盈。代偿不足时，每搏量和心输出下降，形成体位相关灌注问题。

00:09:29.064 --> 00:09:40.776
The patient may become dizzy, nauseated, pale or hypotensive after lying back. Recognize the timing rather than treating the pressure number without a mechanism.
患者躺下后可能头晕、恶心、苍白或低血压。应识别时间关联，不能脱离机制只治血压数字。

00:09:40.776 --> 00:09:51.744
Preload is a filling/stretch concept, not simply another word for venous return. Following the chain helps explain why relieving compression may improve output.
前负荷是充盈伸展概念，并非静脉回流的同义词。沿机制链思考，才能解释解除压迫为什么可能改善心输出。

00:09:51.744 --> 00:10:04.752
The enlarged uterus may also compress the aorta, adding a downstream perfusion effect. Maternal symptoms and uteroplacental supply do not necessarily change in a perfectly matched way.
增大的子宫也可能压主动脉，进一步影响下游灌注。母体症状与子宫胎盘供血，不一定完全同步变化。

00:10:04.752 --> 00:10:16.512
The school mechanism is therefore aortocaval, not only a low-pressure cuff problem. Effective maternal circulation matters to the fetus even if a symptom seems mild.
因此学校机制称主动脉腔静脉压迫，不只是袖带读数低。即使症状看似轻，有效母体循环对胎儿仍重要。

00:10:16.512 --> 00:10:27.096
A normal maternal saturation does not prove fetal oxygen delivery. Maternal flow, oxygen content and placental conditions all contribute.
母体血氧正常，不证明胎儿氧输送正常。母体血流、含氧量和胎盘状况都参与其中。

00:10:27.096 --> 00:10:38.544
Support the maternal threat and use the actual obstetric assessment and consultation pathway. Do not postpone that support to obtain a reassuring isolated fetal number.
应支持母体威胁，并使用真实产科评估和咨询路径。不能为取得单个让人放心的胎儿数字，而推迟支持。

00:10:38.544 --> 00:10:47.544
For the non-arrest patient, explain the concern and choose a suitable position that relieves compression while protecting the other immediate priorities.
对非骤停患者，应解释担忧，选择能减轻压迫、又保护其他即时优先的适合体位。

00:10:47.544 --> 00:11:00.312
Left-lateral or a tolerable modified position may help. Manual displacement can be relevant when full lateral positioning is unsuitable, but actual technique requires training and coordination.
左侧卧或可耐受的改良体位可能有帮助。不宜完全侧卧时可能需要手动移位，但实体技术仍需训练和协调。

00:11:00.312 --> 00:11:12.240
Secure the patient, stretcher and attached equipment. If spinal precautions or other injuries matter, coordinate the whole plan rather than twisting one unsupported body region.
需固定患者、担架和相连设备。有脊柱防护或其他损伤时，要协调全盘计划，不能单独扭转未支撑的身体部位。

00:11:12.240 --> 00:11:23.208
Reassess immediately after the change and during conveyance. Do not force a position that worsens ventilation, causes pain or creates a new safety problem.
改变后和转运中需立即复评。不能强迫会恶化通气、增加疼痛或带来新安全问题的体位。

00:11:23.208 --> 00:11:33.456
Do not transfer the non-arrest lateral-position rule directly into maternal cardiac arrest. High-quality minimally interrupted compressions remain fundamental.
不能把非骤停左侧位规则直接搬到母体心脏骤停。高质量、尽少中断的按压仍是基础。

00:11:33.456 --> 00:11:46.128
Current AHA guidance supports supine CPR with manual left uterine displacement when the fundus is at or above the umbilicus, relieving compression without sacrificing the compression surface.
现行AHA支持仰卧CPR，并在宫底达到或高于脐部时手动向左移子宫，在不牺牲按压条件的前提下解除压迫。

00:11:46.128 --> 00:11:58.272
This qualifies the school CPR-with-tilt shortcut. Prioritize effective oxygenation and ventilation, call the appropriate resources and continue the actual maternal-arrest pathway.
这修正了学校“倾斜做CPR”的简写。应优先有效氧合通气、请求适当资源，并继续真实母体骤停路径。

00:11:58.272 --> 00:12:11.184
Resuscitative delivery is a specialized team intervention, not newly authorized PCP surgery. The diagram is a reasoning distinction, not a substitute for a supervised positioning demonstration.
复苏性分娩属于专门团队干预，不是新授权的PCP手术。本图只区分推理分支，不能替代受督导的实体摆位示范。

00:12:11.184 --> 00:12:23.928
At a community book club, a thirty-week pregnant patient lies flat during an assessment and becomes pale and nauseated. The pressure is ninety-eight over sixty with a pulse of one hundred twelve.
社区读书会上，一位孕30周患者在评估中躺平，随后苍白恶心。血压98/60，脉搏112。

00:12:23.928 --> 00:12:35.352
Check the actual ABC and perfusion findings and ask about the positional timing. Relieve likely compression through a suitable secure plan while continuing assessment.
需核真实ABC和灌注发现，并询问症状与体位的时间关联。在继续评估同时，用合适安全计划解除可能压迫。

00:12:35.352 --> 00:12:47.712
After the position changes, symptoms improve and pressure becomes one hundred ten over sixty-eight. Document what changed and the actual response rather than simply writing normal now.
改体位后，症状改善、血压变为110/68。应记录改变的措施及真实反应，而非只写“现在正常”。

00:12:47.712 --> 00:12:58.296
The improvement supports a positional contributor. It does not yet explain why the patient needed help or exclude bleeding, infection, dysrhythmia or thromboembolism.
好转支持存在体位因素，但还没解释本人为什么需要帮助，也不能排出血、感染、心律问题或血栓栓塞。

00:12:58.296 --> 00:13:10.224
Compare the symptoms, mental status, pulse, breathing and pressure before and after repositioning. Keep measurement technique and treatment context attached to the values.
请比较摆位前后的症状、意识、脉搏、呼吸和血压，并保留测量技术及治疗背景。

00:13:10.224 --> 00:13:21.072
Continue the focused history for pain, bleeding, infection or cardiopulmonary symptoms. A response to one intervention does not prove there is only one problem.
继续重点询问疼痛、出血、感染或心肺症状。对一种干预有反应，不证明只有一个问题。

00:13:21.072 --> 00:13:32.904
If the patient remains unwell or worsens, reopen the differential and escalate. Do not repeat the same positioning maneuver indefinitely while another threat progresses.
若患者仍不适或恶化，应重新考虑鉴别并升级，不能在另一威胁进展时，无限重复同一摆位动作。

00:13:32.904 --> 00:13:44.352
Select conveyance and consultation from the actual clinical condition. The broad stable-pregnancy sentence in a general reference is not an automatic non-conveyance clearance.
转运和咨询应依真实病情选择。普通参考中笼统的“稳定孕妇”一句，不是自动不转运许可。

00:13:44.352 --> 00:13:56.472
Obtain the current gestational age or estimated due date and how that estimate was established. Include known multiples, prenatal concerns and recent examinations where relevant.
应取得当前孕周或预产期，并问估计依据；相关时包括已知多胎、产检担忧和近期检查。

00:13:56.472 --> 00:14:09.312
Ask about bleeding, pain, contractions or fluid loss, plus headache, visual change, dyspnea and fever. Do not restrict the history to labour if the complaint is neurological or systemic.
应问出血、疼痛、宫缩或流液，同时问头痛、视变、气促和发热。主诉为神经或全身问题时，不能只问是否临产。

00:14:09.312 --> 00:14:22.392
Previous outcomes, cesarean or other surgery, hypertension, diabetes, medicines and allergies can change the risk assessment. Attribute collateral information and preserve missing details.
既往结局、剖宫产或其他手术、高血压、糖尿病、用药和过敏，可改变风险评估。旁证需注明来源，缺失细节需保留。

00:14:22.392 --> 00:14:34.728
For a recent birth or loss, establish the date and recovery trajectory. New confusion can limit the history, so use available witnesses and records without delaying immediate support.
近期分娩或丢失时，要明确日期和恢复过程。新意识混乱可限制病史，需用可得目击者及记录，但不延误即时支持。

00:14:34.728 --> 00:14:48.024
The uploaded school sheet defines gravida as total pregnancies, including the current pregnancy. Nulligravida means never pregnant, primigravida the first pregnancy and multigravida two or more.
上传的学校表把孕次定义为包括当前在内的总妊娠次数。Nulligravida为从未孕，primigravida为首次孕，multigravida为两次或以上。

00:14:48.024 --> 00:14:59.376
Simple para counts pregnancies reaching the source twenty-week convention regardless of survival. Do not use a later textbook shorthand equating para with live births.
简单产次依来源的20周惯例，计算达到该阶段的妊娠，不论是否存活。不能采用教材后文把产次等同活产的简写。

00:14:59.376 --> 00:15:13.296
In GTPAL, P is specifically preterm pregnancies; it is not the total para of the shorter G-and-P notation. Term and preterm entries count pregnancies, whereas L counts living children.
在GTPAL中，P专指早产妊娠，不是简写G和P中的总产次。足月早产计妊娠，而L计存活子女。

00:15:13.296 --> 00:15:24.168
The handout uses twenty weeks as its recording convention. That convention is not an independent legal registration threshold or a neonatal resuscitation decision.
该表用20周作为记录惯例。此惯例不是独立法律登记阈值，也不是新生儿复苏决定。

00:15:24.168 --> 00:15:34.416
Consider a person pregnant now, with one earlier eight-week loss and one previous twin pregnancy delivered at thirty-five weeks, both children living.
设一位现在怀孕者，过去有一次8周丢失，以及一次35周分娩的双胎妊娠，两名子女都存活。

00:15:34.416 --> 00:15:44.304
There are three total pregnancies including the current one. There are no previous term pregnancies and one previous preterm pregnancy under the school convention.
包括当前在内共有三次妊娠，既往没有足月妊娠，依学校惯例有一次早产妊娠。

00:15:44.304 --> 00:15:55.560
The early loss contributes one to A, and the living twins contribute two to L. The result is G three, T zero, P one, A one, L two.
早期丢失使A为一，存活双胎使L为二。因此记录为G3、T0、P1、A1、L2。

00:15:55.560 --> 00:16:08.040
In the shorter notation the simple para is one, not two. State the history as well as the shorthand if ambiguity could affect care; do not infer outcomes from a bare abbreviation.
在较短记法中，总产次为一而不是二。若简写可能影响照护，应同时说明病史，不能从孤立缩写猜结局。

00:16:08.040 --> 00:16:20.472
The school connects abnormal placental perfusion to maternal vascular and endothelial dysfunction. This can affect the brain, liver, kidneys, lungs and uteroplacental circulation.
学校把胎盘灌注异常与母体血管内皮障碍相连，其效应可涉及脑、肝、肾、肺及子宫胎盘循环。

00:16:20.472 --> 00:16:33.072
Vasoconstriction can raise pressure while permeability changes and microvascular dysfunction impair organs. A high cuff pressure is therefore not reassurance about effective organ perfusion.
血管收缩可升压，同时通透性变化及微血管障碍可损器官。因此袖带压高，不是器官有效灌注的保证。

00:16:33.072 --> 00:16:45.888
Preeclampsia usually develops from twenty weeks onward, but pregnancy history and postpartum presentation also matter. Previously unrecognized disease can present with a major complication.
先兆子痫通常从20周后出现，但妊娠史及产后表现同样重要。此前未识别的病，也可能以严重并发首次呈现。

00:16:45.888 --> 00:16:57.672
Your task is recognition, support and timely definitive assessment, not proving every laboratory criterion in the field or labelling an ongoing case mild and safe.
你的任务是识别、支持及及时确定评估，不是在现场证明全部化验标准，也不是把进展中的病叫轻型安全。

00:16:57.672 --> 00:17:09.936
The checked contemporary classification uses a systolic pressure of at least one hundred forty or a diastolic pressure of at least ninety. Both numbers do not have to be elevated.
核对的现代分类使用收缩压至少140，或舒张压至少90；并非两个数都升高才算。

00:17:09.936 --> 00:17:22.248
A severe pressure is systolic at least one hundred sixty or diastolic at least one hundred ten. Confirm promptly with suitable technique while urgent assessment and care proceed.
严重血压为收缩压至少160，或舒张压至少110。应在紧急评估照护持续时，用合适技术及时确认。

00:17:22.248 --> 00:17:36.264
The public L04 introduction uses greater-than wording and mandatory proteinuria. Contemporary criteria include equality and allow qualifying organ or uteroplacental dysfunction without proteinuria.
公开L04引言使用“大于”及必须蛋白尿措辞；现代标准包含等于，且允许无蛋白尿而有合格器官或子宫胎盘异常。

00:17:36.264 --> 00:17:49.896
The four-hour diagnostic confirmation interval for nonsevere readings is not a prehospital waiting instruction. A symptomatic or severely hypertensive patient needs prompt escalation, not a four-hour scene stay.
非严重值诊断确认的四小时间隔，不是院前等待指令。有症状或严重高血压者需要及时升级，不是在现场待四小时。

00:17:49.896 --> 00:18:46.584
The literal preparation list makes the measurement interpretable: consider acute anxiety, stress or pain; caffeine, smoking or nicotine during the preceding thirty minutes; stimulant-containing medicines; bladder/bowel comfort; tight clothing; room noise/temperature; at least five minutes of rest; and talking before or during the procedure. If conditions cannot be achieved in an emergency, measure, document the limitation and continue urgent care. The source describes discarding the first reading and averaging the later two, with a minute between measurements, for its office context. Original calculation: 142/86, then 136/82 and 134/80 gives a later-two average of 135/81, not an average with a different arm, position or intervention hidden in it.
实际准备清单让测量可解释：考虑急性焦虑、应激或疼痛，前30分钟咖啡因、吸烟或尼古丁，含拟交感兴奋成分药物，膀胱肠道舒适、衣服是否紧、室内噪声温度、至少休息5分钟，以及测量前或中说话。急救不能满足时，应测量、记限制并持续紧急照护。来源在其门诊背景说舍首值、后两次平均，间隔一分钟；原创计算：先142/86，后136/82及134/80，后两次均值135/81，不能暗中把另一手臂、体位或干预后的数值混进去。

00:18:46.584 --> 00:19:37.920
The actual assigned pregnant-client page contains two omitted interactive elements, not a printed full case. The linked public page was inspected without answering or opening feedback: teaching-data slides 1, 3 and 5 show late pregnancy with breathlessness, an elevated diastolic observation relative to the stated baseline, then timed right/left-arm remeasurements after rest. This adds observed case context; it does not recover every interaction, reveal an official answer or establish that breathlessness is benign. Keep arm, position, time, method, symptoms and repeat values distinct in the record. Apply the pregnancy pathway, not the nonpregnant chronic table, and do not erase the higher reading by documenting only the lower arm.
实际指定孕妇病例页含两个被省略的互动元素，不是印好的完整病例。本次只看链接公开页教学数据第1、3、5页，未作答或开反馈：晚孕气促，舒张压相对所给基线升高，休息后按时刻分别复测左右臂。这补入已观察的病例背景，不代表恢复全部互动、揭示官方答案或证明气促良性。记录要区分手臂、体位、时刻、方法、症状及复测值；使用妊娠路径而非非孕慢性表，不能只记较低那臂来抹去高读数。

00:19:37.920 --> 00:19:49.224
Ask about a persistent or severe headache, visual changes and a change in mental function. These can indicate neurological involvement rather than ordinary discomfort.
应问持续或严重头痛、视觉变化及精神功能改变，这些可能提示神经受累，而非普通不适。

00:19:49.224 --> 00:20:00.504
Upper-abdominal or right-upper-quadrant pain, nausea, dyspnea or reduced urine output may add multisystem concern. Assess the full pattern and the trend.
上腹或右上腹痛、恶心、气促或尿量减少，可增加多系统担忧。应评整体模式及趋势。

00:20:00.504 --> 00:20:11.520
Edema alone is not diagnostic, and its absence is not exclusion. You do not need to obtain a positive urine protein test before recognizing a concerning syndrome.
水肿单独不能确诊，没有水肿也不能排除。识别可疑综合征，并不需要先拿到阳性尿蛋白。

00:20:11.520 --> 00:20:23.088
Convey the symptoms, pressures and uncertainty to the receiving team. Definitive investigation and treatment decisions require the appropriate obstetric and medical resources.
需把症状、血压及不确定性传给接收团队。确定检查和治疗决定，需要适当产科及医学资源。

00:20:23.088 --> 00:20:34.608
HELLP stands for hemolysis, elevated liver enzymes and low platelets. The name links red-cell injury, liver involvement and a bleeding-related laboratory problem.
HELLP指溶血、肝酶升高及血小板低，名称联系红细胞损伤、肝受累和出血相关化验问题。

00:20:34.608 --> 00:20:45.528
A patient may have upper-abdominal pain, malaise or other concerning findings, but a field abdominal examination cannot establish the three laboratory components.
患者可能有上腹痛、不适或其他可疑发现，但现场腹检不能确立这三项化验成分。

00:20:45.528 --> 00:20:56.400
Do not use one apparently acceptable pressure or a missing edema finding to dismiss severe illness. Communicate the pregnancy context, symptoms and changing function.
不能凭一次看似尚可的血压或没有水肿，就轻视严重疾病。应传达妊娠背景、症状及功能变化。

00:20:56.400 --> 00:21:08.736
Urgent specialist assessment matters. Knowing the acronym is useful only if it changes recognition, escalation and careful support rather than creating a false confirmed diagnosis.
紧急专科评估很重要。知道缩写只有在改善识别、升级和谨慎支持时才有用，而不是用来制造虚假的确诊。

00:21:08.736 --> 00:21:20.304
Eclampsia is a major consideration for a new seizure in the relevant pregnancy or postpartum setting. Do not require a previously documented diagnosis of preeclampsia.
在相关妊娠或产后背景出现新抽搐时，子痫是重要考虑。不能要求此前已有书面先兆子痫诊断。

00:21:20.304 --> 00:21:33.120
Other causes remain possible, including hypoglycemia, epilepsy, stroke, infection and toxic or metabolic problems. Pregnancy changes the differential rather than ending it.
低糖、癫痫、卒中、感染及毒性代谢问题等其他原因仍可能存在。妊娠会改变鉴别，而不是结束鉴别。

00:21:33.120 --> 00:21:44.976
Protect the patient from injury, assess and support the airway and breathing, measure glucose and preserve the actual seizure timeline. Do not force the mouth open or insert objects.
需防伤、评估支持气道呼吸、测血糖，并保留真实发作时间线。不能强开口或塞入物件。

00:21:44.976 --> 00:21:55.416
Seek the appropriate additional resources and urgent receiving capability. A quiet interval after convulsions does not prove that the maternal threat has resolved.
应寻求适当额外资源及紧急接收能力。抽搐后暂时安静，不证明母体威胁已解除。

00:21:55.416 --> 00:22:08.664
Current L03 places eclampsia magnesium treatment under ACP, with cardiac monitoring and toxicity surveillance. PCP support and appropriate access are listed separately.
现行L03将子痫镁剂治疗列ACP，并要求心电监测及毒性观察。PCP支持及适当通路另列。

00:22:08.664 --> 00:22:20.496
L04 ACP seizure prophylaxis has a prior consultation requirement. Do not turn a school drug name into an independent PCP prophylaxis or seizure-treatment order.
L04的ACP抽搐预防要求事前咨询。不能把学校提到的药名，变成PCP独立预防或治疗抽搐医嘱。

00:22:20.496 --> 00:22:33.312
The general seizure source similarly places seizure-control midazolam under ACP. Advanced antihypertensive choices and targets do not become a PCP rapid-pressure-lowering plan.
一般抽搐来源也将控发作咪达唑仑列ACP。高级降压药选择和目标，不能变为PCP快速降压计划。

00:22:33.312 --> 00:22:45.816
Report any medicine already given, its dose, route, time and response. Continue effective support and conveyance while the qualified team manages drug-specific decisions.
应报已给药物、剂量、途径、时间及反应。在合资格团队处理药物决定时，持续有效支持和转运。

00:22:45.816 --> 00:22:56.544
A patient can have poor effective circulation despite edema or a high pressure. The answer is not an automatic large-volume bolus for every pregnancy-related complaint.
即使有水肿或高血压，患者仍可能有效循环不足。但答案不是对每种妊娠主诉都自动大量补液。

00:22:56.544 --> 00:23:09.744
Preeclampsia carries pulmonary-edema risk, so assess the actual indication and respiratory condition. Current L04 recommends consultation when PCP fluids are required for care planning.
先兆子痫有肺水肿风险，因此需评真实指征和呼吸情况。现行L04建议PCP需要液体时，就照护计划咨询。

00:23:09.744 --> 00:23:22.368
Use the applicable permitted pathway with response-directed reassessment. Track mentation, pulse, pressure, breathing and any new deterioration, not only the volume delivered.
应依适用获准路径，根据反应复评。需追踪意识、脉搏、血压、呼吸及新恶化，而非只累计已输多少。

00:23:22.368 --> 00:23:34.056
Choose an appropriate destination without unnecessary delay, considering immediate resuscitation needs and obstetric capability. Consult when the tradeoff is uncertain.
应兼顾即时复苏需求与产科能力，选择合适目的地并避免不必要延误；权衡不明时要咨询。

00:23:34.056 --> 00:23:44.664
A thirty-two-week pregnant patient reports a new persistent headache and spots in vision. An appropriately sized cuff gives one hundred sixty-eight over one hundred twelve.
一位孕32周患者报告新发持续头痛及眼前光点。合适袖带测得血压168/112。

00:23:44.664 --> 00:23:55.416
These findings create serious hypertensive-organ concern. Repeat promptly with suitable technique while completing the immediate assessment and organizing urgent care.
这些发现形成严重高血压器官受累担忧。应在完成即时评估及组织紧急照护时，用合适技术及时复测。

00:23:55.416 --> 00:24:07.992
Do not wait for a urine protein result, visible edema or four hours to pass. Do not independently give an advanced magnesium or antihypertensive regimen as an ordinary PCP.
不能等尿蛋白结果、出现可见水肿或等四小时过去；普通PCP也不能独立给高级镁剂或降压方案。

00:24:07.992 --> 00:24:20.472
State the symptoms, actual repeated pressure and response, request the appropriate resources and convey through the clinical destination plan. Keep seizure and respiratory support ready.
应报告症状、实际复测血压和反应，请求适当资源，并按临床目的地计划转运，同时准备抽搐及呼吸支持。

00:24:20.472 --> 00:24:31.080
Ectopic pregnancy commonly involves implantation in a fallopian tube rather than the usual uterine cavity. Rupture can cause life-threatening internal hemorrhage.
异位妊娠常见于着床在输卵管，而非通常子宫腔。破裂可能造成致命内出血。

00:24:31.080 --> 00:24:40.296
The visible vaginal blood may be small even when intraperitoneal bleeding is substantial. Do not judge the internal loss from a pad count alone.
即使腹腔出血明显，阴道可见血仍可能很少。不能只凭垫片数量判断内部失血。

00:24:40.296 --> 00:24:52.848
Pain, faintness or syncope, shoulder-tip pain and poor perfusion increase concern, but a complete classic triad is not required. Ask sensitively about possible pregnancy.
腹痛、近晕或晕厥、肩尖痛和低灌注增加担忧，但不必凑齐经典三联征。应敏感尊重地问妊娠可能。

00:24:52.848 --> 00:25:06.840
A typical six-to-ten-week presentation is not a rule excluding other timings. Suspected ectopic pregnancy needs definitive evaluation even when symptoms improve or the first observations look stable.
典型6至10周表现，不是排除其他时间的规则。疑似异位妊娠即使症状改善或首组观察稳定，仍需确定评估。

00:25:06.840 --> 00:25:20.376
Early bleeding has several causes, including ectopic pregnancy and early pregnancy loss. Field assessment cannot reliably establish complete versus incomplete loss or exclude ectopic implantation.
早孕出血原因多，包括异位妊娠和早期妊娠丢失。现场评估不能可靠确定完全或不完全丢失，也不能排异位着床。

00:25:20.376 --> 00:25:32.496
Record the observed bleeding pattern, pad use, clots and any tissue with respect and consent. Keep the possibility of concealed hemorrhage attached to the perfusion assessment.
应在尊重同意下记录所见出血模式、用垫、血块和组织，并在灌注评估中保留隐匿出血可能。

00:25:32.496 --> 00:25:44.544
Do not perform a routine internal examination, pull protruding tissue or apply an early-loss fundal-massage shortcut from an older chapter. Follow the actual condition-specific pathway.
不能按旧章节简写常规内诊、拉扯突出组织，或对早期丢失作宫底按摩。应依真实特定病情路径。

00:25:44.544 --> 00:25:57.000
Prevent heat loss, support the actual threat, use permitted analgesia or fluids only when indicated, and arrange appropriate urgent evaluation with an accurate early notification.
需防失温、支持真实威胁，仅在有指征时使用获准镇痛或液体，并安排适当紧急评估及准确提前预警。

00:25:57.000 --> 00:26:08.784
At a craft market, a patient with a possible eight-week pregnancy develops abdominal pain and faintness. The patient is pale, with a pressure of eighty-eight over fifty-four.
手工市集中，一位病史可能孕8周者出现腹痛和近晕，面色苍白，血压88/54。

00:26:08.784 --> 00:26:19.392
Only a small amount of blood is visible on a pad. That does not reconcile away the shock concern, because the major loss could be concealed inside the abdomen.
垫片上只见少量血，这不能消除休克担忧，因为主要失血可能藏在腹腔。

00:26:19.392 --> 00:26:33.672
Support airway, breathing and perfusion, prevent heat loss, request resources and mobilize toward surgically capable evaluation through the actual pathway. Do not stand the patient to prove orthostatic change.
应支持气道、呼吸和灌注、防失温、请求资源，并依真实路径动员至有手术能力的评估。不能让患者站起来证明体位性变化。

00:26:33.672 --> 00:26:46.824
Report suspected internal hemorrhage and possible ectopic pregnancy as concerns, not a field-confirmed diagnosis. Convey the history, observations, actual treatment and response with times.
应将疑似内出血及可能异位妊娠作为担忧报告，而非现场确诊。需计时交接病史、观察、真实治疗及反应。

00:26:46.824 --> 00:26:59.376
Ask how long ago birth or pregnancy loss occurred and what recovery has been like. New symptoms should be compared with the actual recovery, not dismissed because the pregnancy is over.
应问分娩或妊娠丢失距今多久，以及恢复过程。新症状需与真实恢复相比，不能因妊娠已结束而轻视。

00:26:59.376 --> 00:27:11.736
Preeclampsia can first appear postpartum even after normal prenatal pressures. The checked professional education describes occurrence up to six weeks, not a guarantee that later symptoms are safe.
孕期血压正常者，也可首次出现产后先兆子痫。核对的专业教育描述可至六周出现，但不是保证更晚症状就安全。

00:27:11.736 --> 00:27:26.040
Hemorrhage, infection, thromboembolism or cardiomyopathy can also threaten the postpartum patient. Headache, dyspnea, fever, bleeding or confusion needs a focused but broad assessment.
产后患者也可能受出血、感染、血栓栓塞或心肌病威胁。头痛、气促、发热、出血或混乱，需要有重点但不封闭的评估。

00:27:26.040 --> 00:27:37.896
Do not assume sleep deprivation or anxiety explains altered function before assessing immediate medical causes. Respectful communication and medical assessment should happen together.
评估即时医学原因前，不能假定睡眠不足或焦虑解释了功能变化。尊重沟通与医学评估应同时进行。

00:27:37.896 --> 00:27:49.200
The school asks you to verbalize What Else during overlapping presentations. Use the real chronology to rank alternatives rather than reciting every obstetric diagnosis.
学校要求在表现重叠时口述What Else。应利用真实时序给鉴别排序，而非背诵所有产科诊断。

00:27:49.200 --> 00:27:59.496
For confirmed recent postpartum illness, hemorrhage, infection, hypertensive neurological disease, thromboembolism and glucose problems can be relevant branches.
对已确认近期产后的病情，出血、感染、高血压神经疾病、血栓栓塞及血糖问题，都可能是相关分支。

00:27:59.496 --> 00:28:12.912
The school example also names ectopic pregnancy, but do not mechanically force that onto a verified postpartum timeline. Clarify whether the history actually concerns a current pregnancy or a loss.
学校例子也提异位妊娠，但不能机械套到已核实的产后时间线。应澄清病史是否其实指当前妊娠或一次妊娠丢失。

00:28:12.912 --> 00:28:24.912
Choose an immediate discriminator without delaying rescue: measured glucose, bleeding assessment, pressure and neurological findings, source history or cardiopulmonary assessment.
可选择不延误救援的即时区分观察：实测血糖、出血评估、血压和神经发现、感染源病史，或心肺评估。

00:28:24.912 --> 00:28:36.792
A possible infection with otherwise unexplained organ dysfunction should raise concern for maternal sepsis. Fever is not required, and fever alone does not establish sepsis.
可能感染伴其他解释不足的器官功能异常，应引起母体脓毒症担忧。不必有发热，单有发热也不能确诊脓毒症。

00:28:36.792 --> 00:28:49.584
Ask about source symptoms and recent delivery, surgery, wounds or urinary problems. New confusion, poor perfusion, worsening breathing or falling urine output adds urgency.
需问感染源症状，以及近期分娩、手术、伤口或尿路问题。新混乱、低灌注、呼吸恶化或尿量下降，会增加紧急度。

00:28:49.584 --> 00:29:03.072
Pregnancy baseline changes can overlap generic SIRS observations. The school screening exercise remains useful, but a single score cannot rule the condition in or out or justify waiting for shock.
妊娠基线变化可能与通用SIRS观察重叠。学校筛查练习仍有用，但单个分数不能确诊或排除，也不能作为等到休克的理由。

00:29:03.072 --> 00:29:16.560
Use careful response-directed support, early escalation and appropriate pre-notification. The following medical session develops sepsis recognition and anaphylaxis in the school Saturday sequence.
应谨慎依反应支持、尽早升级并适当预警。后续医学课将依学校周六顺序，展开脓毒症识别及过敏性反应。

00:29:16.560 --> 00:29:27.624
Lead with the actual maternal threat and pregnancy context. Include gestational age or delivery/loss date, how it was obtained and any important uncertainty.
应先报真实母体威胁及妊娠背景，包括孕周或分娩丢失日期、取得方式及重要不确定。

00:29:27.624 --> 00:29:37.680
Give the symptom and seizure timeline where relevant, actual pressure and glucose findings, bleeding or source clues, and the change in function or perfusion.
相关时要报症状、抽搐时间线、真实血压和血糖、出血或感染源线索，以及功能灌注变化。

00:29:37.680 --> 00:29:50.472
Describe the position or treatment actually used and the observed response. Do not report a confirmed ectopic, HELLP or sepsis diagnosis when you have only a working concern.
需描述实际体位或治疗及观察反应。只有工作担忧时，不能报告异位妊娠、HELLP或脓毒症已经确诊。

00:29:50.472 --> 00:30:01.992
State ETA and the capability or assistance needed, use the current handover structure and document the accepted transfer. Preserve the same chronology in the PCR.
应报告预计到达时间、所需能力支援，使用现行交接结构并记录责任接收；PCR中保留相同时序。

00:30:01.992 --> 00:30:10.008
You should be able to explain the main cardiovascular and respiratory adaptations without using them to excuse a new dangerous presentation.
现在你应能解释主要心血管和呼吸适应，而不是用适应替新的危险表现开脱。

00:30:10.008 --> 00:30:20.592
Trace compression to reduced filling and show which positioning branch applies. Actual maneuver technique and safe stretcher handling still require supervised practice.
需把压迫追到充盈下降，并指出适用的体位分支。真实手法及安全担架操作，仍需受督导练习。

00:30:20.592 --> 00:30:31.512
Recognize preeclampsia warning features, a pregnancy-associated seizure and possible concealed ectopic hemorrhage. Preserve the current role and medication boundaries.
需识别先兆子痫警讯、妊娠相关抽搐，以及可能隐匿的异位妊娠出血，并保留现行角色用药边界。

00:30:31.512 --> 00:30:45.528
Use the original cases and paired reading to rehearse a focused history, the school maternity notation and a truthful handover. Continue the week with sepsis, endocrine and gastrointestinal integration.
请用原创病例和中英阅读，练重点病史、学校产科记法及真实交接；随后继续本周脓毒症、内分泌和胃肠串联。
